  "title": "OlmoEarth v1.3 Embeddings",
  "version": "v1.3",
  "description": "Annual 10 m, 128-dimensional per-pixel embeddings from OlmoEarth-v1.3-Base (Ai2), each summarising one calendar year of Sentinel-1, Sentinel-2 and Landsat 8/9 observations. Trained with Matryoshka embeddings, so the first 64 dimensions are a complete embedding on their own. Covers land and most of the coastal zone from 59.5°S to 83.6°N as a Zarr v3 store with one group per UTM zone; meant as input features for classifiers or regressors fit on labelled points, without running the model.",
