      "License: OlmoEarth Artifact License (restricts military, defense-related and extractive-industry use).",
      "Year coverage: the tech report says global for 2023-2025 and selected countries for 2017-2022; the Source Cooperative README (as of 2026-10-27) says global for 2021-2025 and selected countries for 2017-2020, backfilling. Recorded the README's.",
      "Benchmarks: the report evaluates embeddings computed by tiling the ViT, not bit-identical to the released Searchlight embeddings; it reports a negligible difference on PASTIS (val mIoU 60.4 vs 59.8).",
      "encoder_model.id is null: OlmoEarth v1.3 is a new model (tech report) and has no record yet; the 'olmoearth' record describes v1.",
