  "processing:level": "Sentinel-1 RTC; Sentinel-2 L2A; Landsat Collection 2 Level-1",
  "processing:lineage": "Each year is split into twelve 30-day periods ending on 1 January of the following year; for each modality and period, scenes covering a window are composited into one mosaic by first valid pixel, least cloudy first for Sentinel-2 and Landsat, giving 12 timesteps per modality. Computed in 2048 x 2048 pixel windows per UTM zone (EPSG:326NN, southern zones too) with Searchlight inference; scenes behind every embedding are listed in GeoParquet provenance tables.",
  "spatial_resolution": "10m",
  "regions_coverage": [
    "Global (land and most of the coastal zone, 59.5°S to 83.6°N; no Antarctica)"
  ],
