  "temporal_coverage_note": "As of 2026-10-27: global for 2021-2025; 2017-2020 only for selected countries, backfill to global ongoing. The store has one slot per year 2017-2025; a window crossing the antimeridian in zones 1 and 60 is skipped every year.",
